}

\p{Not run: the M8 gate of the pristine base next to the candidate's for a comparison cell by cell (the counters of section 4.1 are that comparison on the whole corpora); the driver's invariance suite (the driver is not touched, and a verdict that depended on the worker count would show in the rows above only by chance); the reference engine's own gate (not touched).}
}
}

\subtree{
\title{5. The guard at the present cap}

\p{The rule of [the decision for a default](dec-YP0N): on the eight corpora the geometric mean of the warm passes goes down and no corpus is more than 3 \% slower, over at least three interleaved rounds, on the executable (the target) and on the JVM launcher (which must not regress). Base against candidate, both without any option, 8 workers, one window per launcher; the host was busy (section 1.3), so the CPU ratio of every round is given beside the ratio of the passes.}

